The registry-first sample tests/registry/pf.jsonl contains addresses and coordinates from the
Base Adresse Nationale file for French Polynesia (adresses-987.csv.gz, last modified 2026-10-30),
under Licence Ouverte / Open Licence 2.0
(https://www.etalab.gouv.fr/licence-ouverte-open-licence/). Source: Base Adresse Nationale and
its contributing communes, https://adresse.data.gouv.fr/. The Gouvernement de la Polynésie
française republishes the same addresses as "Adressage en Polynésie française" under the same
licence.

Changes: a sample was drawn and the query forms constructed from the file's fields. Per-case file
checksums and retrieval dates are recorded in the corpus; docs/evaluation/registry/pf.md records
the upstream checksum.
